{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224020/extras/da5c785954a7dd9a38d9b74f8484f51f.avif?t=1770287527\" width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy Tale is a mysterious puzzle-platformer crafted in a minimalist style, inspired by old, grim fairy tales where children found themselves in eerie places\u2014and only a few lucky ones ever made it back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While walking with your brother, everything turns into horror and drags the hero into a series of terrible events. Your brother has been kidnapped, and you are left face-to-face with an ominous forest filled with dangers and strange creatures. Solve the puzzles that you meet on the way, do not let yourself be caught, and save your brother!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out the dark story that befell the once-calm and peaceful forest, turning it into a creepy place filled with evil. Perhaps it is you who will be able to solve all the secrets of the forest and save the peaceful creatures?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224020/extras/e7434a3513e306cf6d7ffb0e3c9717f6.poster.avif?t=1770287527\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224020/extras/e7434a3513e306cf6d7ffb0e3c9717f6.webm?t=1770287527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224020/extras/e7434a3513e306cf6d7ffb0e3c9717f6.mp4?t=1770287527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224020/extras/5739cc8eb9a2fabe581f3092de4ecf61.webp?t=1770287527\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puzzle-platformer in the spirit of Limbo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features of a classic adventure: collect items for your inventory and use them in a variety of situations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is not only a quest, you will have to hide, run away, jump high, and even ... learn to play the reedpipe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A truly creepy soundtrack and beautiful 2D art will take you to a dark tale and give you few unforgettable hours!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"3bcdece99c6646480756cb3e6e38ce706dc189a7.jpg","localized_name":"Follow to the brother","name":"Follow to the brother","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1224020/3bcdece99c6646480756cb3e6e38ce706dc189a7.jpg"},{"icon":"1df480b885024a2ba9e444611fd5d26a9cb69ca6.jpg","localized_name":"Naivety","name":"Naivety","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1224020/1df480b885024a2ba9e444611fd5d26a9cb69ca6.jpg"},{"icon":"d4b297ecf034d10c41d7fa5b41c17c8e9ecca4a7.jpg","localized_name":"Happy end","name":"Happy end","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1224020/d4b297ecf034d10c41d7fa5b41c17c8e9ecca4a7.jpg"},{"icon":"a740d5f73d58e5a8aef5e3a4a00a96f28c569ab5.jpg","localized_name":"Dominance","name":"Dominance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1224020/a740d5f73d58e5a8aef5e3a4a00a96f28c569ab5.jpg"},{"icon":"17f579154f27399608601b8ca8fdf4f7ea04d44f.jpg","localized_name":"Incorrigible researcher","name":"Incorrigible researcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1224020/17f579154f27